  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno tūmanile gīkī, ī numba yise ī ya mu sī ūlū yūsambagūlwa, tūlī na numba ya kūfuma kūlī Mulungu; numba ya ng'wigūlū ya būja na būja, īyo ītī ya kūbeejiwa na makono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ūmo tūlī ī haha tūkūgang'hīlaga, tūlī na ng'hūmbū ningī no ja kūzwalīchiwa nzengo gwise mpya, ū gwa ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū tūzwalīchiwa, tūtūbiza tūlī dūūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana aho tūlī ū mu numba ya kwengemekeja īyī, tūkūlīlaga kūlwa nguno ya makoye; ītī gīkī tūtogilwe kūzuula, alīyo tūtogilwe kūzwalīla, ū mīlī gwa kūcha gūmilwe na būpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulungu ng'wenekīlī h'ūyo atūlonja longegije ū mhayo gwenūyū, ūtwinha na Moyo Ng'wela kūlwa koolecha gīkī tūlī bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū tūlī bashisha ng'holò, īkī tūmanile gīkī aho tūtaalī tūlī mu mīlī tūtī hamò nū Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mu kashimīzīle kise tūkatongeelagwa kūzunya, ītī kūbona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana tūlī bashisha ng'holò, gwike tūkūbonaga gīkī, īlī hambū hambū twīnge ū mu mīlī tūje kaya kūlī Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū, nūūlū tūbize tūlī kaya, nūūlū tūtī kaya, ī ng'hūmbū jise jilī kūnyeja we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bose pye shitwigeleelilwe kwīmīīla kū būtongi w'isumbī lya kūlamulīla lya ng'wa Kilisito; būlī ng'wene anukūle mheela ya kūlenganīla nī yīyo akwītaga aho ataalī mu mīlī, ībize yawiza, nūūlū yabūbi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nīmo gwa būsangīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose īkī tūlūmanile ū logohano ūlo lwigeleelilwe kūlī Seeba, tūkūbahūgūlaga a banhū. A bise tūmanīkile hape ū kūlī Mulungu, hama nalisagīlwa gīkī nū mu wiyangūji wa mung'holò jing'we tūmanīkile hape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūtatogilwe kwandya kwihaya hangī ū kū bing'we, alīyo tūlīng'winha nzīla ya kwikumīlīgīja ning'we kūlwa nguno yise; mupandīke ya kūyūbashokeja abo basendamīlile mihayo ya higūlya gūlya, ītī ya mu ng'holò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise nūūlū tūkabiza twahūganile, nahene īlī kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Mulungu; hama ūlū tūbiza tūlī batengeke, īlī kūlwa nguno ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū būtogwa bo ng'wa Kilisito būkūtūkomelejaga tūfunye būlamuji būlī gīkī, ūmò akacha kūlwa nguno ya bose, hūna lūūlū pye a bose būūcha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akacha kūlwa nguno ya bose, gīkī a bapanga batizūbiza bapanga hangī kūlwa nguno yabo; alīyo kūlwa nguno yakwe ūyo akabachīlīla, hama ūjūūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, kūfuma haha a bise tūtatogilwe kūng'witegeleja munhū nūūlū ūmò mu nhūngwa ja mīlī; nūūlū īkī ū Kilisito twalī tūmanile mu mbika ya mīlī ī kwandya, alīyo ī haha tūtang'witegelegije mu gīko hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, munhū ose ose ūlū alī mulī Kilisito, alī shiseeng'wa shipya; ī ya kale yamalaga kūbīta, ī haha īlīho mipya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī yose īyī īfumile kūlī Mulungu, ūyo wamala kūtūsangīja hamò nang'hwe wei ng'wenekīlī mu nzīla ya ng'wa Kilisito; hūna na a bise ūtwinha nīmo gwa būsangīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gīt'ūmo ū mulī Kilisito ū Mulungu walī na nīmo gwa kūbasangīja a ba mu sī hamò nang'hwe, kūlwa kūleka kūbabalīla ū būkenaagūji wabo, na a bise watwinha mhayo gwa kūtūūla būsangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose a bise tūlī batūmami ha ng'wanya go ng'wa Kilisito, hū kūhaya ū Mulungu alībiza gītī alikūmbīlīja kūbītīla mu bise. Ali lūūlū, tūlīng'wikūmbīlīja kūlwa ng'wa Kilisito, bizagi na būsangī nang'hwe ū Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū wei akang'wīta kūbiza shibi ūyo walī atamanile shibi, kūlwa nguno yise; gīkī a bise tūbize būtūngīlīja wa ng'wa Mulungu mu nzīla yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
